@startuml EtatCameraFSM
!include ../style.iuml
title The Mountain - Etats - CameraType (CameraMan)

[*] --> ThirdPerson : _Ready()

state FirstPerson {
    FirstPerson : suit l'os tete
    FirstPerson : cache le modele
}
state ThirdPerson {
    ThirdPerson : spring arm + raycast
    ThirdPerson : _yaw/_pitch libres
}
state FreeMode {
    FreeMode : camera libre\n(debug, non utilise)
}
state Death {
    Death : vue speciale\n(non utilise)
}

ThirdPerson --> FirstPerson : SetCameraType(FP)\naction change_view
FirstPerson --> ThirdPerson : SetCameraType(TP)\naction change_view
ThirdPerson --> FreeMode : SetNextCamera(..)
FirstPerson --> ThirdPerson : ragdoll force TP
ThirdPerson --> Death : (reserve)
Death --> ThirdPerson : (reserve)

note right of ThirdPerson
  Transitions interpolees via
  _lerpT (8 u/s). Basis et
  Position sont lerp entre les
  cibles FP et TP.
end note

@enduml
